WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.640 --> 00:00:01.520
<i>When I sleep,</i>

00:00:02.120 --> 00:00:02.960
<i>I dream.</i>

00:00:03.520 --> 00:00:06.280 position:63%
<i>And in my dream, someone wants my crown.</i>

00:00:12.320 --> 00:00:13.440
<i>There is God...</i>

00:00:14.480 --> 00:00:16.160
<i>and there are the Peaky Blinders.</i>

00:00:21.680 --> 00:00:23.360
<i>People think that I'm gonna fall.</i>

00:00:23.760 --> 00:00:25.320
<i>Who's gonna take the throne, eh?</i>

00:00:28.920 --> 00:00:31.920 position:63%
We have never even heard of your people.

00:00:32.200 --> 00:00:35.160 position:58%
So we are not afraid of your threats.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:38.400
<i>They said that Tommy Shelby
was a spent force,</i>

00:00:38.800 --> 00:00:40.000
that he was spent in the head.

00:00:40.720 --> 00:00:41.560
<i>Three,</i>

00:00:42.040 --> 00:00:43.120
<i>two,</i>

00:00:43.200 --> 00:00:44.200
one.

00:00:44.280 --> 00:00:45.320
Bang.

00:00:47.240 --> 00:00:50.000 position:56%
So, Tommy Shelby, it's war you want,

00:00:50.560 --> 00:00:52.480
<i>it's war you shall have.</i>

00:00:54.600 --> 00:00:55.840
<i>There will be a war,</i>

00:00:57.480 --> 00:00:58.920
<i>and one of you will die,</i>

00:01:00.560 --> 00:01:02.000
but which one, I cannot tell.

00:01:02.440 --> 00:01:05.080 position:63%
Mr. Shelby, you've come to my attention.

00:01:05.440 --> 00:01:09.000 position:59%
I will have need of men like you,
except there is no other man like you.

00:01:09.320 --> 00:01:11.320
Sometimes killing is a kindness.

00:01:13.160 --> 00:01:15.760 position:63%
It will be Tommy Shelby who's crucified,

00:01:15.840 --> 00:01:17.800
<i>and there will be no resurrection.</i>

00:01:24.120 --> 00:01:25.880
<i>We own the ropes.
Who's gonna hang us now?</i>

00:01:25.960 --> 00:01:27.320
No one is gonna hang you, Tommy.

00:01:27.400 --> 00:01:28.720
<i>You're gonna hang yourself.</i>

00:01:29.560 --> 00:01:31.800 position:56%
Do you have some kind of death wish,
Mr. Shelby?

00:01:33.680 --> 00:01:34.960
Nothing can stop us.

00:01:42.680 --> 00:01:43.840
Now you've heard of us.

